# Context7 (user-approved MCP)

When implementation depends on a library, framework, or API whose docs may
have changed since model training (Express, Jest, Cursor APIs, OpenSpec,
Graphify, Serena, npm packages, etc.), query **Context7** via the project
MCP server in `.cursor/mcp.json` before inventing signatures.

This server is **user-approved**, not an ad-hoc shadow MCP. Do not add
other MCP servers without approval. Do not commit API keys; Context7
runs without a key.

Serena (same `mcp.json`) is for this repo's semantic code intelligence.
Use Context7 for **upstream library docs**; use Serena for **this tree**.
